<title>CANADA: Chrysler Canada April sales rise 7.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Chrysler Canada April sales rise 7.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WINDSOR, Ontario 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chrysler Canada Ltd said on Thursday its sales for April were as follows:</p>
<p>		     PCT CHANGE	    1997	     1996</p>
<p>   Total	   +7.8		    24,298	   22,544</p>
<p>   Cars	    +4.8		     9,515	    9,077</p>
<p>   Trucks	  +9.8		    14,783	   13,467</p>
<p>   YEAR-TO-DATE  PCT CHANGE	    1996	     1995</p>
<p>   Total	   +3.4		    78,487	   75,916</p>
<p>   Cars	    -4.0		    26,732	   27,857</p>
<p>   Trucks	  +7.7		    51,755	   48,059</p>
<p>Note: Chrysler Canada is a unit of Chrysler Corp.</p>
<p>-- Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100</p>
</text>
